Write a C++ program that takes an amount in rupees (as an integer) and calculates the minimum number of currency notes needed to make that amount using the denominations: 1000, 500, 100, 50, 20, 10, 5, and 1. We assume that a user will enter an amount >1000 and amount <= 9999.
